  "prefLabel": "Rev 1608.03 Amended Tax Returns",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1608.03 Amended Tax Returns.\n\n(a) Retailers amending an original communications services tax return shall file a Form DP-135, communications services tax return, and place an “X” in the box next to the word “Amended Return” on the return.\n\n(b) Amended communications services tax returns not requesting a refund or credit shall be filed within 3 years of the filing date for the original return.\n\n(c) Amended communications services tax returns requesting a refund or credit shall be filed by whichever date is later:\n\n(1) Within 3 years of the original due date for the tax; or\n\n(2) Within 2 years from the date the tax was paid.\n\n(d) The 2-year period from the date the tax was actually paid shall not be applicable to an amended return requesting a refund or credit where the payment of tax, interest, or penalty that was paid was a result of an assessment or a demand for payment.\n\nSource. #6336, eff 9-24-96 (from Rev 1605); ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12; renumbered by #13002 (formerly Rev 1607.03); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1600.html"
